{"id":"12F","title":"Courtesy and Kindness","part":{"n":12,"title":"Etiquette and moral issues"},"url":"/law/12-etiquette-and-moral-issues/12f","entries":[{"id":"12F.1","text":"We are exhorted to be courteous.","refs":[{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":3,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"1 Pet 3:8."},{"id":"12F.2","text":"Be peaceable, well behaved, showing courtesy and every consideration to all men.","refs":[{"book":"Titus","chapter":3,"verses":"2"}],"citation":"Titus 3:2."},{"id":"12F.3","text":"Brotherly kindness is needed to be fruitful in the knowledge of Jesus Christ.","refs":[{"book":"2 Peter","chapter":1,"verses":"5-7"}],"citation":"2 Pet 1:5-7."},{"id":"12F.4","text":"We are to show kindness to one another.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":12,"verses":"10"},{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":6,"verses":"6"},{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":4,"verses":"32"},{"book":"Colossians","chapter":3,"verses":"12"}],"citation":"Rom. 12:10; 2 Cor. 6:6; Eph. 4:32; Col. 3:12."}]}